{"title":"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A farmer’s house is in the shape of a convex pentagon with perimeter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. The yard\naround the house includes all points that are at a distance at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> meters from the house. Find\nthe area of the farmer’s lot (yard plus house).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2016 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathcontest.unm.edu/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title